  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "We consider each option and substitute the values then solve the equation using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c1a2f9ab33e780cba5010b6de702b28619de1d1b1c922808fce2123379d05d37.png] \n\nOption 1) 4, 2 and ÷, +\n\n19 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ + 5 × 2 = 27\n\n19 - 2 + __**5 × 2**__ = 27\n\n__**19**__ - 2 __**+ 10**__ = 27\n\n__**29 - 2**__ = 27\n\n27 = 27 \n\nOption 2) 5, 2 and ÷, +\n\n19 - __**5 ÷ 4**__ + 2 × 4 = 27\n\n19 - 1.25 + __**2 × 4**__ = 27\n\n__**19**__ - 1.25 __**+ **____8__** = 27\n\n27 - 1.25 = 27 \n\n25.75 ≠ 27 \n\nOption 3) 5, 2 and ÷, -\n\n__**19 ÷ 5**__ + 4 - 2 × 4 = 27\n\n3.8 + 4 - __**2**____** × 4**__** **= 27\n__**3.8 + 4**__ - 8 = 27\n\n__**7.8 - 8**__ = 27\n\n-0.2 ≠ 27 \n\nOption 4) 4, 2 and ÷, -\n\n__**19 ÷ 4**__ + 2 - 5 × 2 = 27\n\n4.75 + 2 - __**5 × 2**__ = 27\n\n__**4.75 + 2**__ - 10 = 27\n\n__**6.75 - 10**__ = 27\n\n-3.25 ≠ 27\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 1)**",
